msgid ""
"The SULILLGH7-P1/P2 flight controller supports up to 16 PWM outputs. First 8"
" outputs (labelled 1 to 8) are controlled by a dedicated STM32F103 IO "
"controller. The remaining 8 outputs (labelled 9 to 16) are the \"auxiliary\""
" outputs. These are directly attached to the STM32H753 FMU controller. All "
"16 outputs support normal PWM output formats. All 16 outputs support DShot, "
"except 15 and 16."
msgstr ""
"SULILLGH7-P1/P2 飞控最多支持 16 路 PWM 输出。前 8 路输出（标记为 1 至 8）由专用的 STM32F103 IO "
"控制器控制。其余 8 路输出（标记为 9 至 16）为“辅助”输出，直接连接到 STM32H753 FMU 控制器。全部 16 路输出都支持普通 PWM"
" 输出格式。除 15 和 16 外，其余输出都支持 DShot。"

